  }, {
    "id" : "555c98d5",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Builds one self-contained bilingual Beirut landing page, "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "src/main/resources/beirut.html",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : ", in four tasks: skeleton with SEO head and landmarks, section content with hotlinked photos and gradient fallbacks, an English/Arabic dictionary toggle with RTL mirroring, and responsive, accessible, reduced-motion-aware styling. JUnit tests parse the source to check each acceptance criterion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "id" : "feature-design-h",
    "type" : "heading",
    "props" : {
      "level" : 2
    },
    "content" : [ {
