      "level" : 3
    },
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Scope and grounding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "id" : "ba65ad32",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "The spec has no Data model, no root bean, no screens and no Artifacts: the deliverable is one static, self-contained HTML file. No entity, enum or platform catalog applies, so none is reused or created; there is nothing to persist or migrate. The design is therefore the page's structure, its content model (an in-file bilingual dictionary) and its behaviours."
    } ]
